    "mijn-gezondheid/docs/scaffold-templates/project/domain/entity.mustache": "{{!\n  Domain entity: built from its domain request through a package-private constructor (only the Factory and the\n  Mother call it), validated into a Notification, reconstituted by adapters through the package-private builder.\n  Exemplars: therapeutic-relation-domain .../exclusion/TherapeuticExclusion.java,\n             authentication-domain .../BlockedAudience.java (builder for reconstitution).\n  Target: <capability>-domain/src/main/java/<pkg>/<Name>.java\n  Package: \"package\" is the full package of the file (no suffix is appended).\n  Vars:   package, Name, imports[] (extra imports, e.g. \"java.time.LocalDate\"),\n          fields[type, name, notBlank (bool: StringValidator.notBlank instead of ObjectValidator.notNull)]\n  Left to you: behaviour (named mutations returning validate(), as BlockedAudience.changeEndpoints), extra rules.\n}}\npackage {{{package}}};\n\nimport be.mijngezondheid.common.domain.validation.Notification;\nimport be.mijngezondheid.common.domain.validation.ObjectValidator;\nimport be.mijngezondheid.common.domain.validation.StringValidator;\nimport lombok.AccessLevel;\nimport lombok.AllArgsConstructor;\nimport lombok.Builder;\nimport lombok.EqualsAndHashCode;\nimport lombok.Getter;\nimport lombok.ToString;\n{{#imports}}\nimport {{{.}}};\n{{/imports}}\n\n@Getter\n@Builder\n@EqualsAndHashCode\n@ToString\n@AllArgsConstructor(access = AccessLevel.PACKAGE)\npublic class {{{Name}}} {\n\n{{#fields}}\n    private final {{{type}}} {{{name}}};\n{{/fields}}\n\n    {{{Name}}}(Create{{{Name}}}DomainRequest request) {\n{{#fields}}\n        this.{{{name}}} = request.get{{{Cap}}}();\n{{/fields}}\n    }\n\n    public Notification validate() {\n        var notification = Notification.empty();\n{{#fields}}\n{{#notBlank}}\n        StringValidator.notBlank(\"{{{Name}}}.{{{name}}}\", {{{name}}}, notification);\n{{/notBlank}}\n{{^notBlank}}\n{{^primitive}}\n        ObjectValidator.notNull(\"{{{Name}}}.{{{name}}}\", {{{name}}}, notification);\n{{/primitive}}\n{{/notBlank}}\n{{/fields}}\n        return notification;\n    }\n}\n",
